This project is a Swift port of XBolo (https://github.com/bananazon/xbolo), itself a
clone of Bolo by Stuart Cheshire. XBolo's game-code license is reproduced below and
retained per its terms; new work in this repository is offered under the same terms.

Note: XBolo also bundles TCMPortMapper, a separate dependency licensed under the GPLv3
(see https://github.com/bananazon/TCMPortMapper). That code is NOT included in this
project. This port avoids it deliberately so this repository can remain MIT-licensed
throughout — see docs/FIDELITY.md and the project plan for the Phase 6 networking
replacement.

